{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜解讀APEC(三)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-19-13-40-44lvX73teD.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：解讀APEC</p><p>國家主席習近平在APEC發表講話，期望共同踐行真正的多邊主義，推動構建更公正全球治理體系，對中俄美元首會晤有何啟示？對全球大局有何影響？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港城市大學商學院客座教授陳鳳翔</p><p>智明研究所總監許楨</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:43:58.104376+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:27:06.966917+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:26.506751+00:00","content_hash":"1d8ba0421a19e59a0309f8ff1e566ac1428b89ba78cf722f2f8850769683101e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}